Hello all who's left on this list,

I'm seeing many farewells lately from those who are leaving "us", having
migrated elsewhere.

I guess farewell to those guys is in order, however I hope I'm not the only
one sticking with tru64 on alphas.

I do not plan to migrate away from tru64 on alphas and there aren't any
superiors and bean counters to tell me what to do or force me to switch.

So I might be the last of the mohicans on this list, but I hope not to be
the only one left for years to come...

Thanks to all who have been and hopefully will continue being on this list!


-- 
Didier Godefroy
